          "name": "`morph_to`: the area under the line",
          "source": "docs/content-video-engine/CAPABILITIES.md:109"
        }
      ],
      "does": "The area under one line becomes another line's area mid-page by as-rigid-as-possible morphing.",
      "when": null,
